{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "Resumable Data Ingestion \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HResumable Data Ingestion\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nA batch ID hashes the immutable source content. Each row effect, validation failure and cursor update commit together. Bad rows enter quarantine; corrected input is a new batch and upserts the same business ID.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HResumable Data Ingestion\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:24.632861+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0229,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"checkpoint\": {\r\n      \"batch\": \"13e58de75bfc3541a45f6a52d666eb7b1b96734651aa5e6aae16caee34e942bc\",\r\n      \"cursor\": 2,\r\n      \"total\": 4,\r\n      \"done\": false,\r\n      \"customers\": 2,\r\n      \"quarantined\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"resumed\": {\r\n      \"batch\": \"13e58de75bfc3541a45f6a52d666eb7b1b96734651aa5e6aae16caee34e942bc\",\r\n      \"cursor\": 4,\r\n      \"total\": 4,\r\n      \"done\": true,\r\n      \"customers\": 2,\r\n      \"quarantined\": 1\r\n    },\r\n    \"corrected\": {\r\n      \"batch\": \"092494bb7ba38df6f0d3ca3dcc2497eed4d3c03eb0740c855fcb451bab0ec08d\",\r\n      \"cursor\": 1,\r\n      \"total\": 1,\r\n      \"done\": true,\r\n      \"customers\": 3,\r\n      \"quarantined\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"customers\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"1\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Alex Demo\",\r\n        \"email\": \"alex@example.test\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"2\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Sam Demo\",\r\n        \"email\": \"sam@example.test\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"3\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Invalid corrected\",\r\n        \"email\": \"fixed@example.test\"\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"quarantine\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"batch\": \"13e58de75bfc3541a45f6a52d666eb7b1b96734651aa5e6aae16caee34e942bc\",\r\n        \"row\": 3,\r\n        \"raw\": {\r\n          \"id\": \"3\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Invalid\",\r\n          \"email\": \"not-an-email\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"reason\": \"1 validation error for CustomerInput\\nemail\\n  String should match pattern '^[^\\\\s@]+@[^\\\\s@]+\\\\.[^\\\\s@]+$' [type=string_pattern_mismatch, input_value='not-an-email', input_type=str]\\n    For further information visit https://errors.pydantic.dev/2.14/v/string_pattern_mismatch\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
[20, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HResumable Data Ingestion\r\nBehavior under test\r\n\r\n..s                                                                      [100%]\r\n2 passed, 1 skipped in 0.18s"]
[30, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HResumable Data Ingestion\r\nMeasured evaluation / fixture mode\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"passed\": true,\r\n  \"scenario\": {\r\n    \"checkpoint\": {\r\n      \"batch\": \"13e58de75bfc3541a45f6a52d666eb7b1b96734651aa5e6aae16caee34e942bc\",\r\n      \"cursor\": 2,\r\n      \"total\": 4,\r\n      \"done\": false,\r\n      \"customers\": 2,\r\n      \"quarantined\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"resumed\": {\r\n      \"batch\": \"13e58de75bfc3541a45f6a52d666eb7b1b96734651aa5e6aae16caee34e942bc\",\r\n      \"cursor\": 4,\r\n      \"total\": 4,\r\n      \"done\": true,\r\n      \"customers\": 2,\r\n      \"quarantined\": 1\r\n    },\r\n    \"corrected\": {\r\n      \"batch\": \"092494bb7ba38df6f0d3ca3dcc2497eed4d3c03eb0740c855fcb451bab0ec08d\",\r\n      \"cursor\": 1,\r\n      \"total\": 1,\r\n      \"done\": true,\r\n      \"customers\": 3,\r\n      \"quarantined\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"customers\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"1\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Alex Demo\",\r\n        \"email\": \"alex@example.test\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"2\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Sam Demo\",\r\n        \"email\": \"sam@example.test\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"3\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Invalid corrected\",\r\n        \"email\": \"fixed@example.test\"\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"quarantine\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"batch\": \"13e58de75bfc3541a45f6a52d666eb7b1b96734651aa5e6aae16caee34e942bc\",\r\n        \"row\": 3,\r\n        \"raw\": {\r\n          \"id\": \"3\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Invalid\",\r\n          \"email\": \"not-an-email\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"reason\": \"1 validation error for CustomerInput\\nemail\\n  String should match pattern '^[^\\\\s@]+@[^\\\\s@]+\\\\.[^\\\\s@]+$' [type=string_pattern_mismatch, input_value='not-an-email', input_type=str]\\n    For further information visit https://errors.pydantic.dev/2.14/v/string_pattern_mismatch\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}"]
[40, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HResumable Data Ingestion\r\nTradeoffs to explain at interview\r\n\r\nInputs are bounded and loaded into memory. SQLite mode assumes one importer per batch; PostgreSQL locks the batch row. Upserts use source order, not a cross-source conflict policy.\r\n"]
[50, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HResumable Data Ingestion\r\nRun it yourself\r\n\r\ngit clone https://github.com/danielpdev/resumable-data-ingestion.git\r\ncd resumable-data-ingestion\r\nmake setup\r\nmake demo\r\nmake test\r\nmake eval\r\n\r\nSee README.md and docs/INTERVIEW_RO.md.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted portfolio project. Synthetic data.\r\nNo production customer claims."]
